{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c30d9fd65d814aa69747f72fa13813b7b7751e16b189c41ecfff2fd0b5959e60", "ja": "（今日は、アイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の\n撮影だ。少し早く着いてしまったな……）", "zh": "（今天是偶像写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》的拍摄。\n我有点太早到了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "0cbfdfa6e189ba7d63bd476ff1ae5ad520ac45ce524fe2b2e409a1fc4e172fe4", "ja": "あっ……\nおはようございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊……\n早安，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eb0b4fb52c042ff3940d1de970f9ba8bbe7401d8b23413ff0aa6c369a866a505", "ja": "おはよう、琴葉。\nずいぶん早いんだな……何かしてたのか？", "zh": "早安，琴叶。\n你来得真早……你刚才有事可做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "46b5d0e9b8e9693b63cbf04f115745942b8d1ebb58853acc34f4fc1bd6a25ef4", "ja": "はい。少し早めに着いてしまったので、\n教室の掃除を。もう、だいたい終わりました。", "zh": "有的。因为我有点太早到了，就去打扫教室。\n已经大致打扫完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b4299225f318c14f963c1c53adca2e53a648df85d6421d528b18be5995f51574", "ja": "えっ、どうして掃除を？", "zh": "咦？为什么要打扫？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "578a333f1d9b6a1b61dee4b075ab2f4d2b0650a1b29da4e674f32113fa875a35", "ja": "今日は、学校での撮影ですから。普段と\n同じことをしていたほうが、自然に見えるかと思って。", "zh": "今天是在学校里拍摄，\n我觉得照常行动，看起来可能会比较自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3b5861cde8284111f73ede6f9afae8838173dfb9f91836a8da73531709b99d5", "ja": "花瓶のお水も取り換えたし、黒板消しも叩いたし。\nえーと、あと他には……。", "zh": "我已经换了花瓶里的水，也把黑板擦的灰拍干净了。\n呃──其他还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1f2b47b0625591451f46b2b24a470ae3ff6d4227ec0afab1d223b41b7b1f543b", "ja": "なるほど。琴葉は普段、\n学校でこんな風に生活しているんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，\n这就是琴叶平常的校园生活吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "4b45f0b053c727e63e6c3388deac6c54daa4d45af4613ca3accfba525fbf12ac", "ja": "あ……はい、そうですね。\nクラス委員なので、仕事は多いほうかもしれません。", "zh": "啊……对，没有错。\n我是班长，要做的事可能比较多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "3e7b484d81cb15ac3c11fdabbe11a2c34a1ac1aec681e360f87e735150fef5f5", "ja": "でも、やりがいがあって楽しいですよ。\nクラスのみんなも手伝ってくれますし。", "zh": "但做完很有成就感，我可以说是乐在其中。\n而且班上同学也都会帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2601abf43c45e220c2210cc83f2bce81a1e2bebdc1be5dd7d4605efcfadd1157", "ja": "琴葉は真面目だな……見習わないと。", "zh": "琴叶真是认真……我得向你看齐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "748b51b765c893d3151d323903599c8096989e5363d9a294b2c3def830d4a530", "ja": "見習うだなんて、そんな。\n私は、いつもどおりにしてるだけですから。", "zh": "说什么看齐，太夸张了。\n我只是在做一如往常的事而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "124ac2c55eee8169b24fa8cf1d0f01b3daa26bad763b92ddf34e40d8570e34f1", "ja": "教室は、いつもいる場所なので……\n綺麗だと落ち着くし、気分がいいんです。", "zh": "教室是我平时待的地方……\n打扫干净会让我觉得平静又舒适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "14cf18e0ed5c60c86430966204f6ebbd7c100090cbaf946e0decc58d4c2ef96f", "ja": "綺麗だと落ち着く、か。\n劇場がいつも綺麗なのも、琴葉のおかげかもな。", "zh": "打扫干净就会觉得平静啊。\n剧场总是保持干净可能也是琴叶的功劳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ece012c967292f626f770a62193550201ed267fd49fc6808a7e5506f57232fe", "ja": "たしかに、劇場は普段いる場所です。\nでも、落ち着くのとはちょっと違うかな。", "zh": "剧场确实是我平常待的地方，\n但可能有点不一样，不太会让我觉得平静。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "42bfcb79039c40a30ebc1ffa44b23acf1875adfcb0e9a06931a7dc7059f6f6e2", "ja": "だっていくら張り紙をしても、みんな\n言うことを聞いてくれないんですから。ふふ……。", "zh": "因为不管贴再多张告示，\n大家都不会乖乖听话嘛，呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ebd529369a8a155255f13fd625386218e4d32d38fc1c5b5b09b493786cf69a27", "ja": "はは、確かにそうだな。\n気がつくと、どこかからボールが飛んでくるし……。", "zh": "哈哈，确实是这样。\n每次一回神都会发现有球飞过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "b0ea130206cf469661f2ca324bfb77344b00af41ff78cf6f4d01cfe99fa65cec", "ja": "でも、ケガをしたら危ないので、注意は続けます。\n散らかしたら、片付けも手伝ってもらいますし。", "zh": "但要是受伤可就危险了，所以我会继续叮咛大家。\n要是太乱了，我也会请大家帮忙收拾干净。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "49048576730453e62ea18f691733503aa17e81e7a8066ed4567704153845f3d1", "ja": "さすが、クラス委員の貫禄だな。", "zh": "不愧是班长，真有威严。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "1e0ce2bc4114ddfaecfd387b199232bc96c1552e33785479cfa7f27c15a5bcbb", "ja": "そんな、大したことじゃないと思いますけど……\nあ、スタッフの方が来たみたいですね。", "zh": "哪有，这没什么大不了的……\n啊，工作人员好像来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "09187baac6f6c141718821c5c6b25707246f9899e23043f98181b92f92c852ee", "ja": "{$P$}。\n今日も1日、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n今天也请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1021_p", "source_sha256": "8626d18b8ae644aa79e648c77f8c30ff736f85723c7bd27079ddd3dabc2ac928", "ja": "ああ、こちらこそよろしく！", "zh": "嗯，我也要请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0093_1022_p", "source_sha256": "319d899c539d89387621ff0acff31d95e1aced00502745597bb95eca816c3877", "ja": "（その後の撮影はスムーズに進んだ。しっかり者の\nクラス委員……普段の琴葉を連想させる、いい写真だ）", "zh": "（之后拍摄进行得很顺利。照片中认真可靠的班长……\n让人联想到琴叶平常的模样，拍得真是好极了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
